    WHEN `England and Wales` THEN `s 73(3) in the same way as an order of the High Court`
    WHEN `Northern Ireland` THEN `s 73(3) in the same way as an order of the High Court`
    WHEN Scotland THEN `s 73(3) in the same way as a decree of the Court of Session`

